   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WISH program was implemented in 11 provinces of the DRC including Kinshasa, Kwango, Kwilu, Nord-Ubangi, Sud-Ubangi, Tshopo, Haut-Katanga, Lualaba, Lomami, Mai-ndombe, Haut-Lomami.</narrative>
  </recipient-country>
  <recipient-region code="99" percentage="50" vocabulary="99" vocabulary-uri="https://dkt-rdc.org/">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WISH program was implemented in two lots 1 &amp; 2 covering central and west Africa and a part of Asia. Lot 1 has been implemented by 6 organizations including MSI, IPPF, IPAS, Think place, Leonard Cheshire, and DKT.</narrative>
  </recipient-region>
