   </name>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WISH program was designed for hard-to-reach areas as well as humanitarian settings. As a matter of fact, the choice of provinces was made according to this approach.</narrative>
   </description>
   <activity-description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WISH program enhances individual and community choice about SRHR via social marketing activities, national ownership for more acceptance of family planning activities, and access to SHRH services through pharmacies.</narrative>
   </activity-description>
